From: Joseph Liu <kwliu@nuvoton.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mtd: spi-nor: winbond: add w25q512nwq and w25q01nwq

The 1.8V Winbond parts report JEDEC IDs ef6020 and ef6021, which the 6.1
table lacks, so spi-nor probe fails on both FIU chip selects.

Upstream-Status: Backport [later mainline spi-nor winbond ID additions]
Signed-off-by: Joseph Liu <kwliu@nuvoton.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/winbond.c b/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/winbond.c
index e1753b9b0789..3673175e9246 100644
--- a/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/winbond.c
+++ b/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/winbond.c
@@ -136,6 +136,12 @@ static const struct flash_info winbond_nor_parts[] = {
 	{ "w25q512nwm", INFO(0xef8020, 0, 64 * 1024, 1024)
 		PARSE_SFDP
 		OTP_INFO(256, 3, 0x1000, 0x1000) },
+	{ "w25q512nwq", INFO(0xef6020, 0, 64 * 1024, 1024)
+		PARSE_SFDP
+		OTP_INFO(256, 3, 0x1000, 0x1000) },
+	{ "w25q01nwq", INFO(0xef6021, 0, 64 * 1024, 2048)
+		PARSE_SFDP
+		OTP_INFO(256, 3, 0x1000, 0x1000) },
 	{ "w25q512jvq", INFO(0xef4020, 0, 64 * 1024, 1024)
 		NO_SFDP_FLAGS(SECT_4K | SPI_NOR_DUAL_READ |
 			      SPI_NOR_QUAD_READ) },
